(Nimbus Analytics - Security Whitepaper) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Encryption) Tj T*
(All customer data is encrypted at rest using AES-256.) Tj T*
(Data in transit is protected with TLS 1.2 or higher.) Tj T*
(Encryption keys are managed in AWS KMS and rotated every 90 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Identity and access) Tj T*
(Nimbus supports single sign-on \(SSO\) via SAML 2.0 and OpenID Connect.) Tj T*
(Multi-factor authentication \(MFA\) can be enforced for all users.) Tj T*
(Role-based access control offers Admin, Editor and Viewer roles.) Tj T*
