(Certifications and testing) Tj T*
(Nimbus Analytics holds SOC 2 Type II and ISO 27001 certifications.) Tj T*
(An independent third party performs a penetration test every year.) Tj T*
(Nimbus is not FedRAMP authorized.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Business continuity) Tj T*
(Backups are taken daily and retained for 35 days.) Tj T*
(Recovery point objective \(RPO\) is 24 hours.) Tj T*
(Recovery time objective \(RTO\) is 4 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Data retention) Tj T*
(Customer data is deleted within 30 days after the contract ends.) Tj T*
